820341951}, {"text": "so / you / the pancakes / make / do / OK, / how", "h": 0.013909883895075253, "x": 0.116279080302088, "y": 0.2971656977612197, "w": 0.343470458984375}, {"w": 0.23121458265516495, "x": 0.08922725778040028, "h": 0.014489057089877981, "text": "Extract from Students' Book recording", "y": 0.3460164493061507}, {"x": 0.32558139647384404, "y": 0.34901162806175645, "text": "(0) 1.45", "h": 0.01021671126035137, "w": 0.05187835269504126}, {"x": 0.0875319629230452, "y": 0.36520149522108564, "w": 0.044971851772732205, "h": 0.011878986418892781, "text": "Part 2"}, {"y": 0.3792509023498238, "w": 0.3703040907118056, "h": 0.014133574007220224, "x": 0.08944545387486641, "text": "KG: For the first recipe you just need eggs, potatoes"}, {"h": 0.01138081348329678, "text": "P:", "x": 0.08586762119799747, "y": 0.40844476753469605, "w": 0.017889086405436197}, {"x": 0.1180679823076225, "y": 0.3945348836812778, "text": "and olive oil. It's called a Spanish omelette.", "w": 0.30948120117187494, "h": 0.013909883895075253}, {"x": 0.11985689070412371, "w": 0.1520572408040365, "y": 0.4097093024869127, "h": 0.011549722649130153, "text": "How do you make it?"}, {"w": 0.3847717963324653, "x": 0.0875780154606552, "h": 0.014057253147290583, "y": 0.4223196037312269, "text": "KG: There are many different ways. But this is how you"}, {"h": 0.014133574007220224, "y": 0.4373555958591581, "text": "make a healthy Spanish omelette. First, slice four", "w": 0.34883721245659727, "x": 0.11806797957223794}, {"text": "potatoes. Then boil the potatoes in some water.", "y": 0.4514389537495896, "w": 0.33989264594184027, "h": 0.012645348314774147, "x": 0.11985690131351627}, {"h": 0.0127503461269696, "y": 0.4666133723120896, "w": 0.3416815524631076, "x": 0.11985690388174355, "text": "After that, put the potatoes in a bowl, add some"}, {"y": 0.48052325604355767, "w": 0.16636850992838542, "text": "eggs and mix together.", "h": 0.012645348314774242, "x": 0.11806798325137073}, {"w": 0.023255812327067055, "y": 0.4944331399122397, "x": 0.08407871291070619, "text": "P:", "h": 0.01138081348329678}, {"x": 0.10912343201556123, "w": 0.2576028611924913, "h": 0.012955776173285189, "y": 0.4942824907277105, "text": "OK, so you mix all the ingredients. A"}, {"text": "KG: You need six eggs for four people. So, mix the", "y": 0.5083430235150806, "x": 0.0840787208450422, "w": 0.36135955810546877, "h": 0.015174417977729072}, {"y": 0.5233348374236702, "w": 0.3345259263780382, "h": 0.014133574007220224, "text": "eggs with the potatoes. Then put some olive (N", "x": 0.11627907337925765}, {"x": 0.1663685198755025, "w": 0.31305901421440974, "text": "_) into a pan. Fry the omelette on both sides.", "h": 0.012645348314774242, "y": 0.537427325884764}, {"h": 0.015311371841155259, "w": 0.35957065158420143, "x": 0.11627907382775624, "y": 0.5512093859700066, "text": "And that's it - your Spanish () omelette (_)"}, {"y": 0.5640444101904373, "h": 0.017732667802473224, "x": 0.11255729911487884, "w": 0.3563428412543403, "text": "is ready! Eat it with some salad for a really healthy"}, {"text": "meal.", "w": 0.039355990091959614, "x": 0.11806798056523066, "h": 0.008851743820341951, "y": 0.5816860467155558}, {"h": 0.01337841825795094, "y": 0.5987376986854669, "text": "Extract from Students' Book recording", "x": 0.08390596225157322, "w": 0.23115659925672744}, {"y": 0.6006540699258345, "x": 0.3202146693459147, "w": 0.053667263454861114, "h": 0.010230406496929367, "text": "(4) 1.47"}, {"w": 0.04497993893093534, "y": 0.6206292867003911, "text": "Part 3", "x": 0.08216119304702822, "h": 0.011895496483744236}, {"y": 0.6347965118781413, "x": 0.08228980371425665, "w": 0.34525939941406253, "text": "P: And what about dessert, Kate? My favourite", "h": 0.015347892721637476}, {"w": 0.1574239603678385, "x": 0.11449016462824539, "text": "dessert is pancakes. B", "y": 0.6485740075513637, "h": 0.014133574007220224}, {"w": 0.010733451843261743, "h": 0.010116278651819317, "x": 0.4060822900891026, "text": "?", "y": 0.6499709303150787}, {"text": "KG: Yes, I've got a very easy recipe for fruit (_", "x": 0.08050089294537341, "y": 0.6638808138790613, "h": 0.013909883895075253, "w": 0.3434704928927952}, {"text": "\"pancakes (", "y": 0.6764485563242627, "w": 0.08765652974446615, "h": 0.015311371841155162, "x": 0.1109123423057634}, {"w": 0.01252236048380534, "y": 0.679055232598509, "h": 0.010116278651819414, "text": ").", "x": 0.22361359599542588}, {"w": 0.08774461534288196, "h": 0.011724456165671747, "text": "P: Cool. C", "y": 0.6927932952386597, "x": 0.08045685091582704}, {"x": 0.08228981004443348, "w": 0.33452592637803824, "text": "KG: Some fruit, for example some bananas and", "y": 0.7068750004192843, "h": 0.012759475785472374}, {"h": 0.012704694839160775, "text": "strawberries. Then you need one cup of flour,", "x": 0.11270124675527364, "y": 0.7219900723730954, "w": 0.3220035807291666}, {"h": 0.014133574007220224, "x": 0.11449016696440086, "text": "one cup of milk and one egg. Plus some oil.", "w": 0.3112701076931424, "y": 0.7345532491791026}, {"y": 0.7498646207085785, "w": 0.37209303114149306, "x": 0.08228980237797136, "h": 0.012649913892849272, "text": "P: OK, so bananas, strawberries, flour, milk, an egg"}, {"h": 0.011517766972311145, "y": 0.7650436048072252, "x": 0.11270125877829426, "text": "and oil. What do you do?", "w": 0.18246868557400173}, {"y": 0.7789169673413116, "h": 0.014133574007220224, "x": 0.0787119921602936, "text": "KG: First you chop the fruit and then you make the", "w": 0.35599283854166663}, {"y": 0.7941279071960332, "h": 0.01138081348329678, "x": 0.11270125448822281, "w": 0.06976743910047743, "text": "pancakes."}, {"text": "P:", "x": 0.07871198670772217, "w": 0.021466903686523445, "h": 0.01138081348329678, "y": 0.8080377908537368}, {"text": "D", "x": 0.10375670951630891, "w": 0.02146690368652343, "h": 0.008851743820341951, "y": 0.8080377908172999}, {"w": 0.18604651557074653, "h": 0.012718390075738675, "x": 0.07871198496954625, "y": 0.8219476748062758, "text": "KG: You mix the flour, milk"}, {"h": 0.011481246091828833, "x": 0.11091234416680557, "y": 0.8370216607130464, "text": "and the egg together.", "w": 0.15384614732530383}, {"text": "Then you put some oil", "y": 0.8510319770003574, "h": 0.011508636564984633, "w": 0.1574239603678385, "x": 0.11091234635156083}, {"y": 0.07577166089228625, "x": 0.5456171748977338, "text": "REMEMBER THIS", "w": 0.1395348782009549, "h": 0.012745780548894475}, {"h": 0.011426464771105508, "w": 0.35241502549913195, "text": "In English food names often consist of two words:", "x": 0.5456171697862123, "y": 0.10364620942821001}, {"h": 0.012654478722100659, "text": "adjective + noun or two nouns (compound noun),", "x": 0.5474060888306367, "y": 0.11886627937313614, "w": 0.35241502549913195}, {"text": "e.g. a Spanish omelette (adj + n), a chocolate cake (n + n).", "y": 0.13269855628728275, "h": 0.014133574007220224, "x": 0.5456171890669548, "w": 0.3953488159179688}, {"w": 0.42576026068793393, "h": 0.014133574007220224, "x": 0.5295170127240114, "text": "2 Read REMEMBER THIS. Look at the underlined words", "y": 0.16685469319464558}, {"x": 0.5527728186514369, "y": 0.18209302348090198, "text": "1-5 in the text in Exercise 1 and decide whether the", "w": 0.3899820963541667, "h": 0.012645348314774147}, {"text": "words are adjectives (A) or nouns (N).", "w": 0.2790697564019097, "x": 0.5545617201443046, "y": 0.195907039675026, "h": 0.012741215719642991}, {"y": 0.22129360472336831, "h": 0.008851743820341951, "w": 0.010733451843261688, "text": "3", "x": 0.5295169949191564}, {"h": 0.012695564431834262, "y": 0.22129360491238043, "x": 0.5527728140652621, "w": 0.3810375637478298, "text": "Match the words 1-6 and a-f to make food names."}, {"y": 0.2351669677528284, "h": 0.012681869195256362, "text": "Then complete the sentences with the correct food", "x": 0.5527728039042606, "w": 0.3810375637478298}, {"x": 0.5545617191562411, "text": "names.", "h": 0.008851743820341854, "y": 0.2516424420222418, "w": 0.05545